  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">COnsolidating Sea Turtle conservation in the Azores (COSTA)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The recipient will assess loggerhead bycatch on longline vessels operating in Azorean waters by placing two observers on each of 2 LL vessels during two four month periods (Aug-Sep to Nov-Dec 2015 and Mar-Apr to June-July 2016 and analyze with previously collected bycatch data); restructure the turtle tagging activities in cooperation with local partners and expand tagging program with new partners; and develop a best practices nformation sheet in consultation with NMFS and USFWS for handling hooked or entangled turtles and to be distributed to LL fisherman that dock at Faial and Sao Miguel.</narrative>
  </description>
